              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.1+NUM.16.2+NUM.16.3+NUM.16.4+NUM.16.5+NUM.16.6+NUM.16.7+NUM.16.8+NUM.16.9+NUM.16.10+NUM.16.11+NUM.16.12+NUM.16.13+NUM.16.14+NUM.16.15+NUM.16.16+NUM.16.17+NUM.16.18+NUM.16.19+NUM.16.20+NUM.16.21+NUM.16.22+NUM.16.23+NUM.16.24+NUM.16.25+NUM.16.26+NUM.16.27+NUM.16.28+NUM.16.29+NUM.16.30+NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32+NUM.16.33+NUM.16.34+NUM.16.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:1-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bantu bakacimona! Pantu bakonka imisango yakwa Kaini. Pa mulandufye wa ndalama, baiposa mu cilubo cacitile Balamu. Kanshi nabo balisangukila Lesa nga filya Kora acitile, eico pamo pene nga Kora nabo bakonaulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bantu baba kwati matoni ya fiko pa nsalu, ilyo muli pakulya icakulya cakulanga ukutemwana. Baisakamanafye ukuipakisha ukwabula insoni. Baisakamanafye abene beka. Baba kwati makumbi yalesendwa no mwela ukwabula ukulokesha imfula. Baba kwati miti iyishitwala fitwalo na pa nshita ine ifwile ukutwala, yena iyo miti nga baishula kumo ne mishila, lyena ninshi yafwa libili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba kwati matamba ya pali bemba, basha ifulo lya ficitwa fyabo ifibi. Baba kwati ni ntanda ishenda endafye. Icifulo Lesa abapekanishisha umwakwikala pe, ni mu ncende umwafiita fititi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
