                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enoki uwa mu nkulo yalengele cine lubali ukufuma pali Adamu, aseseme pali aba bantu ati, “Moneni, Imfumu ikesa na bamalaika baiko abamushilo amakana na makana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikesa kukupingula abantu bonse. Ikesa kanda ababifya pa fibi fyonse ifyo bacita mu kubifya kwabo. Ikesa kanda ababifya bonse pa mashiwi yonse ayabi balandile pali Lesa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bantu bailishanyafye lyonse no kwebaula abantu bambi. Bakonkelelafye ulunkumbwa lwabo. Baishibafye ukuitakisha no kusembeleka abantu pakuti bamwenemo ifyo balefwaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
